      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "LET'S HAVE HER (6) lines up chasing another win after sizzling around this track over 300m in 17.35 on August 5. Rates a top chance again if runs up to latest. LIL BIT SAVAGE (1) missed the frame last time but had been racing well prior to that, winning a Maiden three back before a placing at this track the following run. Can improve sharply here. JED FURY (2) was well fancied last time and got off the mark by 0.8 lengths at this track over 300m (18.02). Drawn well off an inside draw. This tougher but looks a leading chance again. REDEEM A ARCADIA (7) comes off a (17.45) win last time, scoring by 1.5 lengths in a Grade 5 over 300m at this track. Already a winner from this draw.",
